                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6844' id='206' type-v2='text' w='96000' x='667' y='33306'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Note :</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>1. One session can have multiple entry points, order placed is attached to the last click entry point.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>2. &quot;All&quot; as entry point will give distinct sessions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>3. Order Placed event was not getting triggered properly till Mid May - bug solved for version 12.62 onwards. Hence total orders through sessions will not match actual orders till all users move to the latest version</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
