    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='glossary'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Talabat/workbooks/DineOutDashboardWIP/glossary?rev=' id='glossary' path='/t/Talabat/workbooks/DineOutDashboard' revision='' site='Talabat' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1300' maxwidth='1000' minheight='1300' minwidth='1000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98770' id='79' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='615'>
            <zone h='98770' id='77' type-v2='layout-basic' w='4200' x='800' y='615'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98770' id='3' type-v2='text' w='4200' x='800' y='615'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='942' h='98770' id='78' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='94200' x='5000' y='615'>
              <zone fixed-size='1244' forceUpdate='true' h='96307' id='80' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='94200' x='5000' y='615'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f9a655' fontsize='12'>Overview Tab</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true'>tPro User Count:</run>
                  <run> A tPro user is a DineOut user who has placed an order during their subscription period.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Total GMV:</run>
                  <run> Final amount paid by the user.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Total User Count:</run>
                  <run> Total number of users placing a DineOut order in the selected time period.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>tPro GMV:</run>
                  <run> Final amount paid by a tPro user.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Total Discount Amount:</run>
                  <run> Total DineOut discount offered.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>tPro Users’ Discount Amount:</run>
                  <run> DineOut discounts used by tPro users.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Total Order Count:</run>
                  <run> Total number of DineOut orders.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>tPro Users’ Order Count:</run>
                  <run> DineOut orders placed by tPro users.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Platform Burn Amount:</run>
                  <run> Talabat’s share of the total co-funded discount.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Vendor Burn Amount:</run>
                  <run> Vendor’s share of the total co-funded discount.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>tPro Acquisitions:</run>
                  <run> A user is considered a tPro acquisition if their first order after subscribing to tPro is a DineOut order.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>DineOut Acquisitions:</run>
                  <run> A user is considered a DineOut acquisition if they place a DineOut order for the first time.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Platform Acquisitions:</run>
                  <run> A user is considered a Platform acquisition if their first order on Talabat is a DineOut order.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>BNPL Acquisitions:</run>
                  <run> A user is considered a BNPL acquisition if their first BNPL order is a DineOut order.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Repeat User Count: </run>
                  <run>User placed a successful  order in the current month and in the last month (M-1)

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Winback  User Count:  </run>
                  <run>User placed a successful  order this month but not in the last month, but has ordered DineOut before.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Churn User Count:  </run>
                  <run>User placed a order in the previous month, but not in the next month


</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontsize='12'>Engagement Tab</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Order Segment:</run>
                  <run> Based on all orders in the last month:

</run>
                  <run italic='true'>Inactive</run>
                  <run> = 0 orders&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run italic='true'>First-timers</run>
                  <run> = 1 order&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run italic='true'>Low</run>
                  <run> ≤ 3 orders&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run italic='true'>Mid</run>
                  <run> = 4 to 8 orders&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run italic='true'>High</run>
                  <run> ≥ 9 orders&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Multi-Verticality Segment:</run>
                  <run> Based on orders in the last month:

</run>
                  <run italic='true'>Inactive</run>
                  <run> = 0 orders&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run italic='true'>Single Vertical</run>
                  <run> = Used one vertical only&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run italic='true'>Multi Vertical</run>
                  <run> = Used multiple verticals&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Discount Segment:</run>
                  <run> Based on all orders (excluding DineOut):

</run>
                  <run italic='true'>Low</run>
                  <run> ≤ 20% of orders are discounted

</run>
                  <run italic='true'>Mid</run>
                  <run> &gt; 20% and &lt; 50%&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run italic='true'>High</run>
                  <run> ≥ 50%&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Home Address:</run>
                  <run> A customer’s home address is defined as the most frequently used delivery location (excluding pickup and DineOut orders).

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Distance for DineOut Orders:</run>
                  <run> The minimum straight-line distance from the DineOut vendor location to any of the user’s delivery addresses.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Delivery Cuisine Preference:</run>
                  <run> Based on last month’s delivery orders, this reflects the proportion of orders across different cuisines.


</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
